    "reasoning": "The variant is located within the CFTR gene on chromosome Not available and is annotated on transcript Not available. It is described as frameshift deletion.\n\nThe submitted variant CFTR:c.68_69delAG was evaluated using multiple publicly available genomic resources including Ensembl, ClinVar, HGVS validation and the educational ACMG-inspired evidence engine.\n\nEnsembl predicts the molecular consequence 'not available'. This consequence is reported for completeness but is not specifically weighted by the simplified ACMG-inspired evidence engine.\n\nBased on the currently available evidence, this educational ACMG-inspired framework classifies the variant as Likely Pathogenic.\n\nThe available evidence supports a likely pathogenic interpretation, although additional clinical and functional evidence would further strengthen confidence.\n\nThis report is intended exclusively for educational and research purposes and must not be used for clinical diagnosis or medical decision making.",
